    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1945987400003662029",
      "url": "https://x.com/pdplabanph/status/1945987400003662029",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/pdplabanph/status/1945987400003662029",
      "text": "📣 𝐂𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐀𝐥𝐥 𝐏𝐃𝐏 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐛𝐞𝐫𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐎𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐚𝐥𝐬 𝐍𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐰𝐢𝐝𝐞! 🇵🇭\n\n𝗙𝗥𝗘𝗘 𝗗𝗨𝗧𝗘𝗥𝗧𝗘 𝗡𝗢𝗪 \n𝗦𝗬𝗡𝗖𝗛𝗥𝗢𝗡𝗜𝗭𝗘𝗗 𝗪𝗢𝗥𝗟𝗗𝗪𝗜𝗗𝗘 𝗥𝗔𝗟𝗟𝗬 👊🏼\n\nPDP is earnestly inviting all its members, officials, and supporters to stand in prayer, unity, and conviction for the Indoor Prayer Gathering for President Rodrigo Roa Duterte. \n\n📆July 19, 2025\n⏰ 5:00 PM (PH Time) \n📍 PDP National Headquarters (2nd Floor, Doña Elena Tower, Sta. Mesa, Manila City)\n\nThis is not just a gathering—it is a bold call to defend truth, justice, and the dignity of a leader who served the nation with courage and compassion. \n\nLet our presence speak louder than fear. Let our prayers rise stronger than silence. \n\n𝗣𝗗𝗣 𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗱𝘀 𝗳𝗶𝗿𝗺. 𝗣𝗗𝗣 𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗱𝘀 𝘂𝗻𝗶𝘁𝗲𝗱.\n𝗙𝗿𝗲𝗲 𝗗𝘂𝘁𝗲𝗿𝘁𝗲 𝗡𝗼𝘄! \n\n#FreeDuterteNow #BringHimHome \n#PDPLaban #PilipinasDutertePaRin",
